    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e62604ae51914795a1343d6d78dfc916",
      "statement": "`docs dev` orchestrates development by: (1) optionally performing an initial full build via `build_command()`, (2) starting a `FileWatcher` monitoring `src/` for changes and triggering incremental rebuilds, and (3) launching the Mintlify dev server (`mint dev --port 3000`) in the `/build` directory with log forwarding, then continuing to watch until interrupted or a process exits abnormally.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://pipeline/commands/dev.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:2eef904e391a0696ec3f202f599e1316dd401011dcea3772bb21c1028cf1cb1a"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d5dc24592ae44ebd809543bd6baeee6f",
      "statement": "`docs build` reads documentation from `src/`, validates the directory exists, creates the `/build` directory if needed, and uses `DocumentationBuilder` to preprocess files and copy them to `/build`, returning exit code 0 on success or 1 on failure.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://pipeline/commands/build.py",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:a5a85b0afc76ae06e835974d1f2826e57fd592ea94a6234be80859f19ee608a7"
