    {
      "id": "claim_c7dacff07fed4813b9207d4b729052d6",
      "statement": "`docs mv <old_path> <new_path>` discovers the Git root and scans `<root>/src` `.md`, `.mdx`, and `.ipynb` documentation content to rewrite relative cross-references to the moved file; it preserves anchors, recalculates internal relative links in the moved Markdown/MDX file or notebook, and supports `--dry-run` previews without writes.",
